  /*************************************************************************/
  /*                                                                       */
  /* <Struct>                                                              */
  /*    GX_BlendRec                                                        */
  /*                                                                       */
  /* <Description>                                                         */
  /*    Data for interpolating a font from a distortable font specified    */
  /*    by the GX *var tables ([fgca]var).                                 */
  /*                                                                       */
  /* <Fields>                                                              */
  /*    num_axis         :: The number of axes along which interpolation   */
  /*                         may happen                                    */
  /*                                                                       */
